    "description": "In 2026, health authorities begin implementing a renewed global plan against antimicrobial resistance across hospitals, farms and environmental systems.",
    "intro": "In 2026, health authorities begin implementing a renewed global plan against antimicrobial resistance across hospitals, farms and environmental systems.",
    "mission": "",
