    "description": "Energy analysts report that electricity demand from data centres rose rapidly in 2025 as AI investment expanded and grid connections became harder to secure.",
    "intro": "Energy analysts report that electricity demand from data centres rose rapidly in 2025 as AI investment expanded and grid connections became harder to secure.",
