    "estimatedMinutes": 24,
    "description": "Global health statistics released in 2026 show important gains in prevention and survival alongside stalled targets, financing pressure and persistent inequality.",
    "intro": "Global health statistics released in 2026 show important gains in prevention and survival alongside stalled targets, financing pressure and persistent inequality.",
    "mission": "",
